1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:11,200
Publishing one approved idea should not require rebuilding the same work across scripts, slides, narration, captions, vertical video, and platform copy.

2
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:18,450
For disabled and energy-limited creators, that repetition can become the barrier to publishing at all.

3
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:22,400
The workflow deliberately stops at review-only.

4
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:28,200
The author remains responsible for meaning, rights, final approval, and publication.

5
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:32,300
A I reduces repetitive production and physical strain.

6
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:36,150
It does not replace authorship or human authority.
